---
// Consulting & Advisory Card Component: Machined Titanium Hardware Plaque
---

<section id="consulting" class="section-container">
  <div class="consulting-card-machined">
    <div class="card-glow"></div>
    
    <div class="card-content">
      <div class="badge-row">
        <span class="engraved-label">[ ADVISORY // 01 ]</span>
        <span class="badge-metal badge-scorched-violet">Seed to Series B</span>
        <span class="badge-metal badge-anodized-green">KMP Architecture</span>
      </div>

      <h2 class="card-title">Free 30-Minute KMP & Mobile Architecture Audit</h2>
      
      <p class="card-pitch">
        Facing the mobile dilemma? You don't have to choose between burning runway on two separate native teams (Swift & Kotlin) or compromising app performance on Flutter or React Native.
      </p>

      <div class="benefits-grid">
        <div class="benefit-item">
          <div class="benefit-icon">📉</div>
          <div>
            <h4>40–50% Engineering Savings</h4>
            <p>Share architecture, network, data caching, and business logic without touching native platform bridges.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-item">
          <div class="benefit-icon">⚡</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Zero Performance Penalty</h4>
            <p>Compiles directly to native ARM machine code on iOS via Kotlin/Native and DEX bytecode on Android.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-item">
          <div class="benefit-icon">🎯</div>
          <div>
            <h4>Brownfield Safe Migration</h4>
            <p>Incrementally adopt KMP into your existing apps module by module without high-risk full rewrites.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="benefit-item highlight">
          <div class="benefit-icon">☕</div>
          <div>
            <h4>In-Person Coffee Superpower</h4>
            <p><strong>See me at a coffee shop or event right now?</strong> Tap my shoulder for <em>unlimited free live consulting</em> while we share a table.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card-action">
        <a href="https://wa.me/14704061747?text=Hi%20Jesus%2C%20I%20saw%20your%20KMP%20portfolio%20and%20would%20like%20to%20chat%20mobile%20architecture!" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button btn-anodized-green">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.711 2.598 2.664-.699c.97.549 1.742.883 2.796.883 3.183 0 5.77-2.587 5.77-5.766.001-3.182-2.585-5.769-5.77-5.769zm10.154 5.767c0 5.614-4.57 10.183-10.185 10.183-1.782 0-3.453-.464-4.912-1.272l-5.688 1.492 1.517-5.541c-.896-1.503-1.402-3.256-1.402-5.132 0-5.614 4.568-10.184 10.185-10.184 5.615 0 10.185 4.57 10.185 10.184z"/></svg>
          <span>Claim 30-Min Audit on WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 3.5rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .consulting-card-machined {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #181b21 0%, #0e1014 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--chamfer-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--chamfer-light);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08),
      0 20px 50px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
  }

  .card-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -30%;
    left: 20%;
    width: 350px;
    height: 350px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(72, 165, 116, 0.18) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(50px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .card-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .badge-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .card-pitch {
    color: var(--text-metal-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .benefits-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .benefit-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
  }

  .benefit-item.highlight {
    background: rgba(37, 87, 62, 0.15);
    border-color: rgba(72, 165, 116, 0.35);
    border-top-color: rgba(118, 227, 171, 0.5);
  }

  .benefit-icon {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .benefit-item h4 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .benefit-item p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-metal-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .benefit-item.highlight em {
    color: var(--anodized-green-edge);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .card-action {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .btn-anodized-green {
    padding: 0 32px;
  }
</style>
